a3439a01237" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444248 1074 "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(p)+(-2q)+(3r)\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the expression has three terms:  $p$, $-2q$, and $3r.$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444235 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1069 "q-176831" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1071 "The third term of the expression $8-\\frac{3}{4}a-\\frac{4}{5}b+2c$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1072 #uuid "4cf8dfa1-a016-55ee-948f-099f977c00ae" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444249 1074 "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(8)+(-\\frac{3}{4}a)+(-\\frac{4}{5}b)+(2c)\n$$\n\nCounting off the terms:\n\n- the first term is $8,$\n\n- the second term is $-\\frac{3}{4}a,$\n\n- the third term is $-\\frac{4}{5}b,$ and\n\n- the fourth term is $2c.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the third term. The third term is $-\\frac{4}{5}b.$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444239 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1069 "q-176829" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1071 "The fourth term of the expression $7u-2v-0.3w+10x$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1072 #uuid "53c72840-d479-512c-a2f9-7b59b04f5d7d" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444250 1074 "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(7u)+(-2v)+(-0.3w)+(10x)\n$$\n\nCounting off the terms:\n\n- the first term is $7u,$\n\n- the second term is $-2v,$\n\n- the third term is $-0.3w,$ and\n\n- the fourth term is $10x.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the fourth term. The fourth term is $10x.$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444232 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1069 "q-176816" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1071 "What are the terms of the expression $7k-5l?$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1072 #uuid "99c23d7a-4cde-50f0-9ab0-eeb0b55149d3" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444251 1074 "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(7k)+(-5l)\n$$\n\nSo, the expression has two terms:  $7k$ and $-5l.$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444237 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1069 "q-43970" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1071 "What's the third term of the expression $\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{2x}{7}-1.3z-6y?$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1072 #uuid "b5e57428-bc9d-562d-b78a-679c20ebb4df" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444252 1074 "We put an addition symbol $(+)$ between each part and separate using parentheses:\n\n$$\n(\\frac{3}{2})+(\\frac{2x}{7})+(-1.3z)+(-6y)\n$$\n\nCounting off the terms:\n\n- the first term is $\\frac{3}{2},$\n\n- the second term is $\\frac{2x}{7},$\n\n- the third term is $-1.3z,$ and\n\n- the fourth term is $-6y.$\n\nIn particular, we are interested in the third term. The third term is $-1.3z.$" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444253 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444234 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444253 1068 #edb/ref 17592186444236 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444253 1069 "q-176839" 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444253 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534921 17592186045417 true] [17592186444253 1071 "Create 